      "approval": true,
      "caveats": [
        "Exactly the original registered-call Delete and Duplicate leaves are approved. Add Defaults, import/export, broader process/list/reopen parents, aliases and structural completion receive no credit.",
        "Actual Qt questions use real handlers with scripted GetYesNo answers. The unchanged Qt PNG is a callable child; no matched outer-list, Delete-question or Duplicate-warning image exists. No Qt pixel, dialog decoration, timing or placement parity is established.",
